      "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Services  (service/)",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Services  (service/)",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "c-svc-text", "x": 900, "y": 585, "width": 340, "height": 660,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null,
      "seed": 32, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1032, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "BookService (interface)\n  · getAllBooks()\n  · getBookById(id)\n  · createBook(Book)\n  · updateBook(id, Book)\n  · deleteBook(id)\n  · findBy{Author,Title,Isbn}\n\nBookServiceImpl\n  ⚠ updateBook sadece 5 alan\n  → Faz 2B: tüm alanlar\n  → Faz 2C: imza DTO alır\n\nUserService\n  · registerUser(u, e, p)\n     → BCrypt.encode\n  · authenticateUser(u, p)\n     → BCrypt.matches\n  · findBy{Username,Email}\n\nUserBookService  @Transactional\n  · addBookToUserCollection\n     (username, BookSuggestion)\n  · removeBookFromCollection\n  · isBookInUserCollection\n  → Faz 2C: BookSuggestion →\n     GoogleBookResult (dto/search)\n\nGoogleBooksService\n  WebClient → googleapis.com\n  · searchBooks(query, max)\n  → BookSuggestion nested\n  → Faz 2C: dto/search/\n     GoogleBookResult'a taşınır",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BookService (interface)\n  · getAllBooks()\n  · getBookById(id)\n  · createBook(Book)\n  · updateBook(id, Book)\n  · deleteBook(id)\n  · findBy{Author,Title,Isbn}\n\nBookServiceImpl\n  ⚠ updateBook sadece 5 alan\n  → Faz 2B: tüm alanlar\n  → Faz 2C: imza DTO alır\n\nUserService\n  · registerUser(u, e, p)\n     → BCrypt.encode\n  · authenticateUser(u, p)\n     → BCrypt.matches\n  · findBy{Username,Email}\n\nUserBookService  @Transactional\n  · addBookToUserCollection\n     (username, BookSuggestion)\n  · removeBookFromCollection\n  · isBookInUserCollection\n  → Faz 2C: BookSuggestion →\n     GoogleBookResult (dto/search)\n\nGoogleBooksService\n  WebClient → googleapis.com\n  · searchBooks(query, max)\n  → BookSuggestion nested\n  → Faz 2C: dto/search/\n     GoogleBookResult'a taşınır",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 12
    },

