    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "d-box", "x": 80, "y": 1320, "width": 2460, "height": 460,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3},
      "seed": 47, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1047, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [], "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "d-text", "x": 100, "y": 1335, "width": 2420, "height": 430,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null,
      "seed": 48, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1048, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "METHOD  PATH                                  AUTH       REQUEST DTO            RESPONSE DTO                       NOT\n─────── ───────────────────────────────────────── ────────── ────────────────────── ──────────────────────────────── ────────────────────────────\n[ AUTH  /api/auth/* ]\nPOST    /api/auth/register                        public     RegisterRequest     →  AuthResponse                    Faz 3A: JWT token alanı dolar\nPOST    /api/auth/login                           public     LoginRequest        →  AuthResponse                    Faz 3A: JWT token alanı dolar\nPOST    /api/auth/logout                          bearer     —                   →  204                              session.invalidate kalkar\nGET     /api/auth/me                              bearer     —                   →  UserResponse                    Bearer → principal\n\n[ BOOK CRUD  /api/books/* ]\nGET     /api/books                                public     —                   →  List<BookResponse>              users alanı sızmaz artık\nGET     /api/books/{id}                           public     —                   →  BookResponse\nPOST    /api/books                                bearer     BookRequest         →  BookResponse  (201)\nPUT     /api/books/{id}                           bearer     BookRequest         →  BookResponse                    Faz 2B: tüm alanlar update edilir\nDELETE  /api/books/{id}                           ADMIN      —                   →  204\nGET     /api/books/search/author                  public     ?author=            →  List<BookResponse>\nGET     /api/books/search/title                   public     ?title=             →  List<BookResponse>\nGET     /api/books/search/isbn                    public     ?isbn=              →  BookResponse\n\n[ GOOGLE BOOKS SEARCH  /api/books/* — Faz 2A ile birleşir ]\nGET     /api/books/google-search    (← /search)   public     ?query= ?max=       →  SearchResponse                   query, count, results\nGET     /api/books/google-suggest   (← /suggest)  public     ?query= ?limit=     →  List<GoogleBookResult>\nPOST    /api/books/collection       (← /add-..)   bearer     AddToCollectionReq  →  BookResponse                    sadece googleBooksId\nGET     /api/books/collection/check (← /check..)  bearer     ?googleBooksId=     →  { inCollection: bool }\n\n[ ADMIN  /api/admin/* ]\nGET     /api/admin/users                          ADMIN      —                   →  List<UserResponse>              Faz 1B: gerçek repo, mock kalkar\n\n[ ERROR  her endpoint ]\n4xx / 5xx                                                                       →  ErrorResponse                   timestamp, status, error, message, path\n400 (validation)                                                                →  ErrorResponse + fieldErrors[]   Faz 2D: @Valid handler\n\n[ REMOVED — silinen endpoint'ler ]\n×  GET   /api/admin/test                                                                                             Faz 1B ✓\n×  GET   /api/test/health,  POST /api/test/echo,  GET /api/test/admin/users                                          Faz 1B ✓\n×  POST  /api/setup/create-admin,  GET /api/setup/test-password                                                      Faz 1A ✓ (kritik açık)\n×  GET   /api/books/test-search                                                                                      Faz 2A ile gidecek\n×  GET   /                                                                                                          Faz 0 ✓ (WebController)",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "METHOD  PATH                                  AUTH       REQUEST DTO            RESPONSE DTO                       NOT\n─────── ───────────────────────────────────────── ────────── ────────────────────── ──────────────────────────────── ────────────────────────────\n[ AUTH  /api/auth/* ]\nPOST    /api/auth/register                        public     RegisterRequest     →  AuthResponse                    Faz 3A: JWT token alanı dolar\nPOST    /api/auth/login                           public     LoginRequest        →  AuthResponse                    Faz 3A: JWT token alanı dolar\nPOST    /api/auth/logout                          bearer     —                   →  204                              session.invalidate kalkar\nGET     /api/auth/me                              bearer     —                   →  UserResponse                    Bearer → principal\n\n[ BOOK CRUD  /api/books/* ]\nGET     /api/books                                public     —                   →  List<BookResponse>              users alanı sızmaz artık\nGET     /api/books/{id}                           public     —                   →  BookResponse\nPOST    /api/books                                bearer     BookRequest         →  BookResponse  (201)\nPUT     /api/books/{id}                           bearer     BookRequest         →  BookResponse                    Faz 2B: tüm alanlar update edilir\nDELETE  /api/books/{id}                           ADMIN      —                   →  204\nGET     /api/books/search/author                  public     ?author=            →  List<BookResponse>\nGET     /api/books/search/title                   public     ?title=             →  List<BookResponse>\nGET     /api/books/search/isbn                    public     ?isbn=              →  BookResponse\n\n[ GOOGLE BOOKS SEARCH  /api/books/* — Faz 2A ile birleşir ]\nGET     /api/books/google-search    (← /search)   public     ?query= ?max=       →  SearchResponse                   query, count, results\nGET     /api/books/google-suggest   (← /suggest)  public     ?query= ?limit=     →  List<GoogleBookResult>\nPOST    /api/books/collection       (← /add-..)   bearer     AddToCollectionReq  →  BookResponse                    sadece googleBooksId\nGET     /api/books/collection/check (← /check..)  bearer     ?googleBooksId=     →  { inCollection: bool }\n\n[ ADMIN  /api/admin/* ]\nGET     /api/admin/users                          ADMIN      —                   →  List<UserResponse>              Faz 1B: gerçek repo, mock kalkar\n\n[ ERROR  her endpoint ]\n4xx / 5xx                                                                       →  ErrorResponse                   timestamp, status, error, message, path\n400 (validation)                                                                →  ErrorResponse + fieldErrors[]   Faz 2D: @Valid handler\n\n[ REMOVED — silinen endpoint'ler ]\n×  GET   /api/admin/test                                                                                             Faz 1B ✓\n×  GET   /api/test/health,  POST /api/test/echo,  GET /api/test/admin/users                                          Faz 1B ✓\n×  POST  /api/setup/create-admin,  GET /api/setup/test-password                                                      Faz 1A ✓ (kritik açık)\n×  GET   /api/books/test-search                                                                                      Faz 2A ile gidecek\n×  GET   /                                                                                                          Faz 0 ✓ (WebController)",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 12
    },

    {
      "type": "text", "id": "e-title", "x": 80, "y": 1810, "width": 600, "height": 30,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null,
      "seed": 49, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1049, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "[E]  Auth Flow Sequence",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[E]  Auth Flow Sequence",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle", "id": "e-box", "x": 80, "y": 1850, "width": 1620, "height": 700,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3},
      "seed": 50, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1050, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [], "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "e-text", "x": 100, "y": 1865, "width": 1580, "height": 670,
      "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null,
      "seed": 51, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1051, "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null, "updated": 1735000000000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "text": "Actors:  Client  ·  AuthController  ·  UserService  ·  JwtService(planned)  ·  SecurityContextHolder  ·  UserRepository  ·  PostgreSQL\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  1) REGISTER  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──POST /api/auth/register  {username, email, password}──▶  AuthController.register(@Valid RegisterRequest)\nAuthController  ──registerUser(u, e, p)──▶  UserService\nUserService  ──existsByUsername(u) / existsByEmail(e)──▶  UserRepository  ──SELECT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserRepository  ◀──false──  UserService\nUserService  ──BCrypt.encode(p)──▶  PasswordEncoder\nUserService  ──save(new User)──▶  UserRepository  ──INSERT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserService  ◀──User──  AuthController\nAuthController  ──generate(user)──▶  JwtService  [PLANNED — Faz 3A]\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  AuthResponse { token, tokenType:\"Bearer\", user: UserResponse }\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  2) LOGIN (planlanan JWT akışı — Faz 3A)  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──POST /api/auth/login  {username, password}──▶  AuthController.login(@Valid LoginRequest)\nAuthController  ──authenticateUser(u, p)──▶  UserService\nUserService  ──findByUsername(u)──▶  UserRepository  ──SELECT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserService  ──BCrypt.matches(raw, hash)──▶  PasswordEncoder\nUserService  ◀──true──  AuthController\nAuthController  ──generate(user)──▶  JwtService  [PLANNED]\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  AuthResponse { token: \"<JWT>\", user }\n\n  ── eski (silinecek) ──\n  AuthController.login eski:  session.setAttribute(\"userId\", ..) + SecurityContextHolder manuel set\n  Faz 3A ile bu satırlar kalkar.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  3) /me  WITH BEARER TOKEN (Faz 3A)  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──GET /api/auth/me  Authorization: Bearer <token>──▶  JwtAuthenticationFilter\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──verify(token)──▶  JwtService\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──set(Authentication)──▶  SecurityContextHolder\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──chain.doFilter──▶  AuthController.getCurrentUser()\nAuthController  ──findByUsername(principal)──▶  UserService  ──▶  UserRepository  ──▶  PostgreSQL\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  UserResponse { id, username, email, role, createdAt }\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  4) FAILURE MODES  ──────────────────────────────────────\n· Register, kullanıcı/email mevcut       →  RuntimeException  →  GlobalExceptionHandler  →  500 ErrorResponse   (Faz 2D: 409 Conflict)\n· Login yanlış parola                    →  AuthResponse {success=false}  (eski) →  400 ErrorResponse (Faz 3A)\n· /me token yok/expired                  →  Filter: 401  ErrorResponse\n· @Valid hata                            →  400  ErrorResponse + fieldErrors[]  (Faz 2D)",
      "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Actors:  Client  ·  AuthController  ·  UserService  ·  JwtService(planned)  ·  SecurityContextHolder  ·  UserRepository  ·  PostgreSQL\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  1) REGISTER  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──POST /api/auth/register  {username, email, password}──▶  AuthController.register(@Valid RegisterRequest)\nAuthController  ──registerUser(u, e, p)──▶  UserService\nUserService  ──existsByUsername(u) / existsByEmail(e)──▶  UserRepository  ──SELECT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserRepository  ◀──false──  UserService\nUserService  ──BCrypt.encode(p)──▶  PasswordEncoder\nUserService  ──save(new User)──▶  UserRepository  ──INSERT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserService  ◀──User──  AuthController\nAuthController  ──generate(user)──▶  JwtService  [PLANNED — Faz 3A]\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  AuthResponse { token, tokenType:\"Bearer\", user: UserResponse }\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  2) LOGIN (planlanan JWT akışı — Faz 3A)  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──POST /api/auth/login  {username, password}──▶  AuthController.login(@Valid LoginRequest)\nAuthController  ──authenticateUser(u, p)──▶  UserService\nUserService  ──findByUsername(u)──▶  UserRepository  ──SELECT──▶  PostgreSQL\nUserService  ──BCrypt.matches(raw, hash)──▶  PasswordEncoder\nUserService  ◀──true──  AuthController\nAuthController  ──generate(user)──▶  JwtService  [PLANNED]\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  AuthResponse { token: \"<JWT>\", user }\n\n  ── eski (silinecek) ──\n  AuthController.login eski:  session.setAttribute(\"userId\", ..) + SecurityContextHolder manuel set\n  Faz 3A ile bu satırlar kalkar.\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  3) /me  WITH BEARER TOKEN (Faz 3A)  ──────────────────────────────────────\nClient  ──GET /api/auth/me  Authorization: Bearer <token>──▶  JwtAuthenticationFilter\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──verify(token)──▶  JwtService\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──set(Authentication)──▶  SecurityContextHolder\nJwtAuthenticationFilter  ──chain.doFilter──▶  AuthController.getCurrentUser()\nAuthController  ──findByUsername(principal)──▶  UserService  ──▶  UserRepository  ──▶  PostgreSQL\nAuthController  ──▶ Client  : 200  UserResponse { id, username, email, role, createdAt }\n\n──────────────────────────────────────  4) FAILURE MODES  ──────────────────────────────────────\n· Register, kullanıcı/email mevcut       →  RuntimeException  →  GlobalExceptionHandler  →  500 ErrorResponse   (Faz 2D: 409 Conflict)\n· Login yanlış parola                    →  AuthResponse {success=false}  (eski) →  400 ErrorResponse (Faz 3A)\n· /me token yok/expired                  →  Filter: 401  ErrorResponse\n· @Valid hata                            →  400  ErrorResponse + fieldErrors[]  (Faz 2D)",
      "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 12
    },

